WEBVTT

00:31.551 --> 00:35.101
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.121 --> 00:38.501
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.771 --> 00:44.741
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.901 --> 00:49.531
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.551 --> 00:53.061
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.081 --> 00:56.571
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.591 --> 01:00.101
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.121 --> 01:06.181
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.441 --> 01:23.721
Si Jin

01:23.741 --> 01:28.241
Episode 11

01:32.601 --> 01:34.031
The black market is full of villains.

01:34.031 --> 01:36.021
His accomplices might be nearby.

01:37.821 --> 01:39.181
Catch him.

01:57.721 --> 02:02.241
(Capital Security Office)

02:02.991 --> 02:04.821
Did I violate any laws?

02:05.591 --> 02:07.631
Why are you arresting me?

02:11.621 --> 02:13.461
Don't say you don't recognize it.

02:17.221 --> 02:20.031
I'll give you a chance to practice.

02:24.311 --> 02:26.631
Where is
the Nightingale Division's base?

02:26.901 --> 02:29.101
How do you usually contact them?

02:30.061 --> 02:32.151
Lackeys of Dazhou.

02:33.061 --> 02:34.871
Stop being so arrogant.

02:35.711 --> 02:37.191
Listen.

02:37.871 --> 02:40.871
Even if I die here today,

02:41.751 --> 02:44.191
I won't reveal a single word.

02:57.431 --> 02:59.381
Is that all you've got?

03:00.431 --> 03:02.261
Scratching an itch, huh?

03:15.381 --> 03:16.821
A real man.

03:17.301 --> 03:19.141
It's fine that you refuse to talk.

03:20.831 --> 03:21.921
Wait a minute.

03:21.941 --> 03:23.081
Where are you going?

03:23.101 --> 03:24.461
Fishing.

03:29.041 --> 03:31.281
(Haitang Chamber)

03:49.781 --> 03:51.351
The Nightingale Token.

03:51.691 --> 03:52.731
(The Nightingale Division)

03:52.731 --> 03:54.531
(found me so soon?)

03:54.551 --> 03:56.481
(Only Yu Qi knows I have)

03:56.501 --> 03:57.981
(the Saintess's Totem.)

03:58.751 --> 04:00.541
(Is he trying to trick me?)

04:14.511 --> 04:16.701
(I used fragrances to get rid of it.)

04:16.741 --> 04:18.191
(How could this happen?)

04:22.781 --> 04:24.191
(It seems this painting)

04:24.191 --> 04:26.821
(has triggered Yu Qi's suspicion
about me.)

04:29.741 --> 04:30.951
(Senior Liu was)

04:30.971 --> 04:32.691
(once an undercover in Tianxiang House.)

04:32.711 --> 04:34.401
(I wonder if she's still there.)

04:34.421 --> 04:36.901
(She might be able to clear up
my confusion.)

04:43.951 --> 04:45.311
Chief,

04:46.471 --> 04:48.391
you gave the Nightingale Token
to Jiang Si?

04:48.391 --> 04:49.881
What if she really is...?

04:49.901 --> 04:52.791
She will lead us
to the Nightingale Division.

04:52.901 --> 04:54.941
What if she remains unmoved?

04:55.071 --> 04:57.551
Then she's less suspicious.

04:58.321 --> 05:01.881
(Capital Security Office)

06:25.861 --> 06:27.101
Come on, hurry up.

06:27.101 --> 06:28.551
Help me.

06:30.271 --> 06:31.631
Are you alright?

06:35.301 --> 06:36.891
Mr. Zhen, you're a scholar.

06:36.891 --> 06:38.871
Why are you practicing martial arts?

06:40.591 --> 06:42.401
You don't understand.

06:43.561 --> 06:45.721
I have someone I want to protect.

06:46.241 --> 06:48.081
If danger arises,

06:50.121 --> 06:52.161
I hope I can protect her.

06:54.281 --> 06:55.721
Yu Qi can do it.

06:57.041 --> 06:58.401
So can I.

08:08.361 --> 08:10.521
I heard Miss Si
likes flowers and plants.

08:10.721 --> 08:11.781
I found this Lan-tsao

08:11.801 --> 08:13.701
by chance in the mountains,

08:13.721 --> 08:15.461
so I brought it to her.

08:15.481 --> 08:16.781
Understood.

08:16.801 --> 08:18.481
Your deep affection

08:18.481 --> 08:19.781
and efforts will surely

08:19.801 --> 08:22.161
be passed on to Miss Si.

08:24.401 --> 08:25.761
Thank you, Aman.

08:29.201 --> 08:35.001
(Tianxiang House)

08:38.921 --> 08:40.281
Great.

08:46.601 --> 08:47.961
Bravo.

08:49.921 --> 08:52.141
- Miss, women are not allowed here.
- Sure.

08:52.161 --> 08:53.761
I'm looking for someone.

08:53.881 --> 08:56.161
The more reason you can't go in.

08:57.761 --> 08:59.121
Ma'am,

08:59.301 --> 09:00.881
please make an exception.

09:06.921 --> 09:08.421
Miss, don't persist.

09:08.441 --> 09:10.521
If all the ladies

09:10.561 --> 09:11.641
of Ling'an

09:11.641 --> 09:13.141
come here to look for someone,

09:13.161 --> 09:14.141
who would dare

09:14.161 --> 09:16.401
visit here now?

09:16.801 --> 09:18.401
You should go back.

09:26.641 --> 09:27.661
Young Master Zhan,

09:27.681 --> 09:28.881
should I hold it for you?

09:28.881 --> 09:29.821
No, no.

09:29.841 --> 09:31.601
I'm practicing pitch-pot.

09:31.761 --> 09:33.461
This is how to practice it.

09:33.481 --> 09:35.481
I must use my mouth.

09:35.641 --> 09:36.921
Use your mouth?

09:36.941 --> 09:38.481
This is the first time I've seen someone

09:38.481 --> 09:40.681
practice pitch-pot with their mouth.

09:41.001 --> 09:42.081
Zhan, this skill of yours

09:42.081 --> 09:43.381
is really impressive.

09:43.401 --> 09:45.001
My dear sister.

09:45.121 --> 09:46.581
You're managing either the household

09:46.581 --> 09:47.521
or the shop every day.

09:47.521 --> 09:48.521
I can't even

09:48.521 --> 09:49.741
find you to chat.

09:49.761 --> 09:51.461
So, I came to find you.

09:51.481 --> 09:52.881
That's more like it.

09:53.121 --> 09:54.481
Bring the tea.

09:54.521 --> 09:57.361
The tea leaves were picked
this morning. Try it.

09:58.981 --> 10:01.061
Zhan, have you been to Tianxiang House?

10:07.961 --> 10:09.441
What Tianxiang House?

10:10.161 --> 10:11.361
I don't even know

10:11.361 --> 10:13.081
which way the door opens.

10:13.881 --> 10:16.581
If I find out who told you about that,

10:16.601 --> 10:18.841
I'll peel their skin off.

10:23.631 --> 10:24.481
I thought

10:24.481 --> 10:26.001
you'd be familiar with the place

10:26.001 --> 10:28.121
so you could help me.

10:28.181 --> 10:29.961
If that's the case,

10:30.361 --> 10:32.361
I'll have to think of another way.

10:33.401 --> 10:35.241
What do you mean?

10:36.361 --> 10:38.121
Do you want to pretend to be a man

10:38.121 --> 10:40.001
and sneak into a brothel?

10:40.521 --> 10:42.101
If it really comes to that,

10:42.121 --> 10:44.081
I'll have to go myself.

10:44.121 --> 10:46.261
Don't. I've been there.

10:46.281 --> 10:47.641
Is that so?

10:48.241 --> 10:49.641
Didn't you just say

10:49.641 --> 10:51.721
you didn't even know

10:51.721 --> 10:52.821
which way their door opened?

10:52.841 --> 10:54.341
I'm familiar with the place.

10:54.361 --> 10:55.421
Familiar?

10:55.441 --> 10:57.421
No, I'm not familiar with it.

10:57.441 --> 10:58.801
I just saw it

10:58.801 --> 11:00.201
while passing by.

11:00.321 --> 11:01.321
If that's the case,

11:01.321 --> 11:03.481
Zhan, you have to help me.

11:03.501 --> 11:04.561
Take me to Tianxiang House.

11:04.561 --> 11:06.021
I want to meet someone.

11:06.201 --> 11:07.561
Meet someone?

11:08.601 --> 11:10.121
Have you fallen for some playboy

11:10.121 --> 11:12.061
who loves to visit brothels?

11:12.081 --> 11:13.181
I don't agree.

11:13.201 --> 11:15.221
Zhan, I want to meet

11:15.241 --> 11:16.821
the courtesan, Liu Yan'er.

11:16.841 --> 11:18.961
You even know Liu Yan'er?

11:19.641 --> 11:20.901
That's not appropriate.

11:20.921 --> 11:22.901
You're a noble lady.

11:22.921 --> 11:25.141
How can you meet with a courtesan?

11:25.161 --> 11:26.881
If Father finds out,

11:26.881 --> 11:28.501
he'll beat me to death.

11:28.521 --> 11:30.781
Everyone in Ling'an knows

11:30.801 --> 11:33.381
Liu Yan'er is an expert in fragrances.

11:33.401 --> 11:35.501
How many patrons have spent lavishly

11:35.521 --> 11:37.381
just to see her make fragrances

11:37.401 --> 11:38.901
for pleasure?

11:38.921 --> 11:40.281
That's true.

11:40.761 --> 11:42.041
Even Tianxiang House's name

11:42.041 --> 11:43.881
came from this.

11:44.921 --> 11:47.141
Are you planning to learn her skills?

11:47.161 --> 11:50.521
How well you know me.

11:50.561 --> 11:52.201
Of course.

11:52.221 --> 11:56.371
- Great.
- Bravo.

11:59.521 --> 12:02.241
Si, stay close to me.

12:07.401 --> 12:09.641
No, no, you can't look.

12:14.401 --> 12:15.281
Gentlemen,

12:15.281 --> 12:17.161
do you know any of the girls here?

12:19.721 --> 12:20.561
It's you.

12:20.561 --> 12:21.681
No, no, it's not me.

12:21.681 --> 12:23.661
I've never been here.
You've mistaken me.

12:23.681 --> 12:24.561
Ma'am,

12:24.581 --> 12:25.901
please make an exception.

12:25.921 --> 12:28.281
We want to see Courtesan Liu.

12:30.081 --> 12:31.661
Since you've snuck in,

12:31.681 --> 12:33.401
I won't expose you

12:33.401 --> 12:34.901
for this gentleman's sake.

12:34.921 --> 12:36.661
You go have fun.

12:36.681 --> 12:38.901
Just don't cause trouble.

12:38.921 --> 12:40.141
Courtesan Liu

12:40.161 --> 12:42.381
is our star attraction.

12:42.401 --> 12:44.381
My business depends on her.

12:44.401 --> 12:46.641
How could I let you go annoy her?

12:48.561 --> 12:49.401
Ma'am...

12:49.401 --> 12:51.121
I also want to meet her.

12:51.281 --> 12:52.881
Is that possible?

12:52.881 --> 12:54.281
Yu.

12:55.401 --> 12:56.761
Well...

12:57.921 --> 12:59.281
If you want to meet Courtesan Liu,

12:59.281 --> 13:00.761
please follow me.

13:01.561 --> 13:02.921
Wait.

13:04.761 --> 13:06.681
Do you also frequent here?

13:07.001 --> 13:09.541
Mr. Zhan, do you also frequent here?

13:09.561 --> 13:10.681
(As expected, it's Yu Qi.)

13:10.701 --> 13:13.041
(He's testing me
with the Nightingale Token.)

13:13.321 --> 13:15.141
Let them both come with me.

13:15.161 --> 13:16.181
Sir,

13:16.201 --> 13:18.261
we have rules.

13:18.281 --> 13:19.161
Courtesan Liu

13:19.161 --> 13:21.021
can only meet one guest at a time.

13:21.041 --> 13:22.401
It's fine if you go alone,

13:22.401 --> 13:25.681
but you can't bring them.

13:26.561 --> 13:28.161
Just help me out here.

13:34.801 --> 13:37.161
Well...

13:38.281 --> 13:39.641
This...

13:43.401 --> 13:44.761
Please come in.

13:45.801 --> 13:47.161
This way.

13:48.681 --> 13:50.121
Miss Liu,

13:50.521 --> 13:53.021
they are...

13:53.041 --> 13:55.781
Miss Liu, you're known
for your art of fragrance.

13:55.801 --> 13:57.981
I also know something about it.

13:58.001 --> 14:00.761
I'd like to ask you about a formula.

14:01.521 --> 14:04.661
Three qian of cloves,
half a liang of Long Nao,

14:04.681 --> 14:08.001
one qian of sapphire-berry,
and a little suhe.

14:08.401 --> 14:10.121
Miss Liu, what do you think?

14:11.761 --> 14:14.001
Ms. Chun, you may go now.

14:14.561 --> 14:15.921
Sure.

14:17.001 --> 14:19.661
The formula you asked about

14:19.681 --> 14:21.261
is my secret recipe.

14:21.281 --> 14:23.641
I wouldn't reveal your secret in public.

14:23.801 --> 14:25.521
But there's one key ingredient

14:25.521 --> 14:26.881
that I don't know.

14:27.001 --> 14:29.641
Could you enlighten me?

14:29.801 --> 14:31.661
It's hard to meet a like-minded friend.

14:31.681 --> 14:33.181
Sir,

14:33.201 --> 14:35.281
please come here.

14:36.761 --> 14:38.921
Yu, let's drink.

14:39.561 --> 14:40.921
I don't drink.

14:41.161 --> 14:42.641
Then eat apricots.

14:58.321 --> 15:00.001
I'll drink then.

15:05.921 --> 15:08.761
Sir, why don't you try this?

15:08.801 --> 15:10.881
It helps calm the mind.

15:49.521 --> 15:53.601
(Liu Yan'er, a nightingale spy)

15:54.761 --> 15:55.661
Jiang Si,

15:55.681 --> 15:58.881
this is your senior, Liu Yan'er.

15:59.041 --> 16:00.501
She just returned from Ling'an.

16:00.521 --> 16:03.401
She'll teach you about fragrances.

16:04.401 --> 16:05.881
Greetings, Senior Liu.

16:18.281 --> 16:19.181
Be careful.

16:19.201 --> 16:21.281
- Are you okay?
- I'm fine.

16:22.921 --> 16:24.281
Here.

16:33.041 --> 16:35.001
This formula is right.

16:36.161 --> 16:37.541
That one too.

16:37.561 --> 16:38.921
Junior, smell this.

16:39.081 --> 16:40.521
It smells so good.

16:45.561 --> 16:46.781
Alright.

16:46.801 --> 16:48.481
They're asleep now.

16:49.201 --> 16:50.561
You look unfamiliar.

16:50.581 --> 16:52.461
What brings you here so suddenly?

16:52.521 --> 16:53.481
I'm Zhao Yu,

16:53.481 --> 16:55.881
Special Envoy of the North Affiliate.

16:56.241 --> 16:57.581
I've run into some trouble,

16:57.601 --> 16:59.181
so I came here.

16:59.201 --> 17:00.641
Trouble?

17:00.841 --> 17:02.821
While on a mission,

17:02.841 --> 17:04.301
I discovered a woman

17:04.321 --> 17:06.221
who carries the Saintess's Totem.

17:06.241 --> 17:08.021
But after investigation,

17:08.041 --> 17:09.041
I found that this woman

17:09.041 --> 17:10.741
had never left Dazhou

17:10.761 --> 17:13.401
and had no contact with Nanwu.

17:13.561 --> 17:14.621
Why don't you report it

17:14.641 --> 17:16.881
to the North Leader?

17:17.321 --> 17:18.421
It's known to everyone

17:18.441 --> 17:20.821
that whoever finds the Saintess
will be heavily rewarded.

17:20.841 --> 17:23.301
Our affiliate is strict with us,

17:23.321 --> 17:26.061
and the leader isn't merciful.

17:26.081 --> 17:27.201
If I

17:27.201 --> 17:28.681
take this woman back rashly,

17:28.701 --> 17:30.461
I'll be fine
if she truly is the Saintess,

17:30.481 --> 17:31.781
but if not,

17:31.801 --> 17:33.801
I'll certainly be punished.

17:34.521 --> 17:35.701
Everyone knows

17:35.721 --> 17:37.181
you're the most experienced

17:37.201 --> 17:39.401
in Ling'an.

17:40.001 --> 17:42.361
If I have to share the reward with you,

17:42.441 --> 17:43.801
I'll accept it.

17:44.041 --> 17:45.261
If I can't see her,

17:45.281 --> 17:46.821
I can't decide.

17:46.841 --> 17:48.741
I'd like to bring her here to meet you,

17:48.761 --> 17:49.861
but as you know,

17:49.881 --> 17:52.061
Ling'an is heavily guarded.

17:52.081 --> 17:53.601
Miss Liu,

17:53.641 --> 17:55.701
apart from the Saintess's Totem,

17:55.721 --> 17:57.401
what other traits

17:57.441 --> 17:59.441
can help verify her identity?

18:00.041 --> 18:01.401
Prophecy.

18:01.761 --> 18:04.541
It's rumored that the Saintess
can foresee the future

18:04.561 --> 18:07.401
and lead Nanwu
into an era of prosperity.

18:13.521 --> 18:14.781
(Now, I surely know)

18:14.801 --> 18:17.081
(what will happen in the future.)

18:17.601 --> 18:20.881
(So, I did become
the Saintess by mistake.)

18:21.441 --> 18:25.761
(Tianxiang House)

18:26.761 --> 18:27.641
I'm not drunk.

18:27.641 --> 18:29.101
Why am I dizzy?

18:29.121 --> 18:30.041
Logically speaking,

18:30.041 --> 18:32.181
this shouldn't happen
with my alcohol tolerance.

18:32.201 --> 18:33.541
This is a bit improper.

18:33.561 --> 18:34.701
Si, are you okay?

18:34.721 --> 18:36.081
I'm fine.

18:36.561 --> 18:37.461
By the way, Zhan,

18:37.481 --> 18:39.221
Qingbao Foodie is nearby.

18:39.241 --> 18:40.321
Their ice custard

18:40.321 --> 18:41.181
is especially tasty.

18:41.201 --> 18:42.981
It should help with your dizziness.

18:43.001 --> 18:44.601
I've been wanting to try it.

18:44.801 --> 18:47.361
- Icy custard?
- But it seems a bit far.

18:47.371 --> 18:48.261
Let's walk faster.

18:48.261 --> 18:49.101
Let's go. No, no.

18:49.111 --> 18:50.221
We can make it in time.

18:50.241 --> 18:51.961
I know that shop. I'll go buy it.

18:51.961 --> 18:54.581
With your speed,
you won't be there before it closes.

18:55.121 --> 18:56.461
Thanks, Commandant Yu.

18:56.481 --> 18:58.041
You're such a good friend.

18:58.081 --> 18:59.801
We'll wait for you here on this street.

18:59.801 --> 19:01.301
- Sure.
- Let's go.

19:01.321 --> 19:02.301
Zhan, since you're dizzy,

19:02.301 --> 19:03.461
let's walk slower.

19:03.481 --> 19:05.641
I should've only had one drink.

19:14.841 --> 19:15.781
Oh, dear.

19:15.801 --> 19:17.021
How can you ride this way?

19:17.041 --> 19:18.561
Get out of my way!

19:19.641 --> 19:21.001
Move!

19:23.081 --> 19:24.441
Stop!

19:24.841 --> 19:25.821
Are you seeking death?

19:25.841 --> 19:26.721
Move aside!

19:26.741 --> 19:28.961
In broad daylight,
do you have any respect for the law?

19:28.961 --> 19:30.401
Go apologize to them.

19:31.081 --> 19:32.441
(Unexpectedly, )

19:32.561 --> 19:34.321
(I still ran into her.)

19:34.841 --> 19:36.101
Si, don't worry.

19:36.121 --> 19:37.061
I'm here for you.

19:37.081 --> 19:38.041
No one

19:38.041 --> 19:39.481
can throw you out.

19:39.801 --> 19:41.161
I'll protect you.

19:42.321 --> 19:44.881
Get out of the way! Move!

19:45.121 --> 19:46.481
Stop!

19:47.841 --> 19:48.801
Are you seeking death?

19:48.801 --> 19:49.901
Move aside!

19:49.901 --> 19:52.181
In broad daylight,
do you have any respect for the law?

19:52.201 --> 19:53.121
Go apologize to them.

19:53.121 --> 19:54.601
Apologize?

19:54.621 --> 19:55.961
I'm a Commandery Princess!

19:55.961 --> 19:57.041
I don't care who you are.

19:57.061 --> 19:59.021
You injured someone,
so you need to apologize.

19:59.041 --> 20:00.081
You must have a death wish.

20:00.081 --> 20:00.981
Say it again.

20:01.001 --> 20:02.601
You must have a death wish!

20:16.121 --> 20:18.181
I'll kill you!

20:18.201 --> 20:22.481
Wake up, Zhan!

20:30.281 --> 20:31.061
(This time, )

20:31.081 --> 20:32.081
(I can't let my brother)

20:32.081 --> 20:33.141
(clash with Cui Mingyue.)

20:33.141 --> 20:35.041
You injured someone,
so you need to apologize.

20:35.041 --> 20:36.141
Otherwise, you can't leave!

20:36.141 --> 20:37.501
You're seeking death!

20:38.561 --> 20:39.781
It's my brother's fault.

20:39.801 --> 20:42.161
I'll apologize on his behalf.

20:42.201 --> 20:44.261
Your Grace, please be lenient

20:44.281 --> 20:45.181
and forgive him.

20:45.181 --> 20:46.121
Si, what are you saying?

20:46.121 --> 20:47.061
Zhan.

20:47.081 --> 20:48.741
Who are you?

20:48.761 --> 20:50.261
It doesn't matter.

20:50.281 --> 20:52.461
You don't need to remember me.

20:52.481 --> 20:54.261
I've long heard

20:54.281 --> 20:56.301
of your elegance and charm.

20:56.321 --> 20:57.281
Seeing you today,

20:57.281 --> 20:58.821
I think you're truly extraordinary.

20:58.841 --> 21:00.881
You're a sweet talker.

21:01.121 --> 21:03.241
But it's him who offended me.

21:03.281 --> 21:05.341
If you want to apologize for him,

21:05.361 --> 21:07.821
kneel and kowtow to me,

21:07.841 --> 21:09.381
and I'll let you go.

21:09.401 --> 21:10.241
What do you think?

21:10.241 --> 21:12.021
Don't push it.

21:12.041 --> 21:13.061
Exactly.

21:13.081 --> 21:14.101
She's bullying them.

21:14.121 --> 21:15.101
Si...

21:15.121 --> 21:16.541
Your Grace,

21:16.561 --> 21:17.961
sorry for our offense.

21:17.961 --> 21:20.161
Please forgive us.

21:22.321 --> 21:25.081
Good. You're a smart girl.

21:25.321 --> 21:27.841
I'll overlook it this time.

21:28.281 --> 21:29.641
Let's go.

21:33.591 --> 21:35.271
How domineering!

21:35.641 --> 21:37.281
How could she be like this?

21:38.641 --> 21:40.241
Si, are you alright?

21:40.641 --> 21:42.161
I'm fine, Zhan.

21:42.241 --> 21:44.341
Why did you apologize to her?

21:44.361 --> 21:45.241
They're both women.

21:45.261 --> 21:46.501
Why the big difference?

21:46.521 --> 21:47.601
One is unreasonable,

21:47.621 --> 21:48.601
and the other is gracious

21:48.601 --> 21:50.821
with extraordinary manners and beauty.

21:50.841 --> 21:51.681
To me,

21:51.681 --> 21:52.631
this girl is just afraid

21:52.641 --> 21:53.861
of revenge on her brother

21:53.881 --> 21:55.541
so she endures such humiliation.

21:55.561 --> 21:57.641
It's truly admirable.

21:57.881 --> 21:59.501
Are you saying

21:59.521 --> 22:01.681
I'm not as good as her?

22:01.841 --> 22:03.201
This...

22:08.281 --> 22:09.641
Stop!

22:11.441 --> 22:12.801
Stop!

22:21.121 --> 22:22.061
How dare you!

22:22.081 --> 22:23.561
As a Commandery Princess of Dazhou,

22:23.561 --> 22:25.001
you rode without cause in the city,

22:25.001 --> 22:26.301
provoking trouble.

22:26.321 --> 22:27.921
You should be flogged.

22:27.941 --> 22:29.981
What gives you the right to arrest me?

22:30.881 --> 22:31.741
Let go!

22:31.761 --> 22:33.821
I'm the Commandant of Capital Security.

22:34.321 --> 22:35.581
I'll take her back.

22:35.601 --> 22:36.961
Remember to eat it.

22:38.961 --> 22:40.641
- Let go.
- Great.

22:40.641 --> 22:41.981
- Great.
- Great.

22:42.001 --> 22:43.661
- Great.
- Great.

22:43.681 --> 22:45.041
(Court, Capital Security)

22:45.041 --> 22:46.181
My daughter is ignorant.

22:46.201 --> 22:47.421
Sorry, Commandant Yu.

22:47.441 --> 22:49.841
I'll discipline her more strictly.

22:49.881 --> 22:51.981
I won't take up any more of your time.

22:52.001 --> 22:53.361
Goodbye.

22:55.001 --> 22:56.321
What kind of person is this?

22:56.321 --> 22:57.841
How can he arrest me?

22:57.841 --> 22:59.641
I'll surely deal with you.

23:01.121 --> 23:02.261
Father,

23:02.281 --> 23:04.281
you're the Bulwark-general of the State.

23:04.281 --> 23:06.121
Can he accept your respect?

23:11.561 --> 23:12.921
Mingyue,

23:13.801 --> 23:16.201
if you cause trouble again,

23:16.361 --> 23:17.361
I'll have to leave you

23:17.361 --> 23:19.021
to your mother.

23:19.041 --> 23:21.601
Can you be more obedient?

23:24.481 --> 23:25.721
I know I was wrong.

23:25.721 --> 23:27.841
Father, don't be angry.

23:29.801 --> 23:31.161
Come here.

23:31.321 --> 23:32.721
Princess Mingyue.

23:32.961 --> 23:34.781
Who are those two who offended me

23:34.801 --> 23:35.781
at the door just now?

23:35.801 --> 23:36.701
Your Grace,

23:36.721 --> 23:37.501
they were

23:37.501 --> 23:39.261
from the Earl Dongping's family.

23:39.281 --> 23:41.121
Earl Dongping's family.

23:41.401 --> 23:44.921
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

23:52.561 --> 23:54.461
Aman, listen up.

23:54.481 --> 23:55.721
From today on,

23:55.721 --> 23:57.041
all of my brother's meals

23:57.041 --> 23:58.981
must be checked by me personally

23:59.001 --> 24:01.021
before you deliver them to him yourself.

24:01.041 --> 24:02.261
Apart from you and me,

24:02.281 --> 24:03.961
no one else can handle it.

24:03.961 --> 24:05.601
- Got it?
- Yes.

24:12.801 --> 24:14.601
Good, no problem.

24:14.901 --> 24:16.661
You can deliver it to him now.

24:20.781 --> 24:22.201
Chief, did you go to Tianxiang House

24:22.201 --> 24:23.461
with Jiang Si?

24:23.481 --> 24:24.781
Is she the Saintess?

24:24.801 --> 24:26.361
Do we need to take action?

24:26.381 --> 24:27.381
She's not the Saintess.

24:27.401 --> 24:29.101
Nor is she
from the Nightingale Division.

24:29.121 --> 24:30.241
She doesn't even know

24:30.241 --> 24:31.881
where the totem came from.

24:33.961 --> 24:35.281
Is she colluding with others

24:35.281 --> 24:37.481
to deceive us?

24:39.121 --> 24:40.601
I believe her.

24:41.521 --> 24:44.581
Go keep an eye on Liu Yan'er
at Tianxiang House.

24:44.601 --> 24:46.521
She's from the Nightingale Division.

24:52.121 --> 24:53.481
Miss.

24:54.241 --> 24:55.821
Take down my sign.

24:55.841 --> 24:57.581
I'm not receiving guests lately.

24:57.601 --> 24:58.961
Yes.

25:11.521 --> 25:12.261
Miss,

25:12.261 --> 25:13.901
what would you like to drink?

25:14.101 --> 25:15.421
A cup of tea, please.

25:15.441 --> 25:16.801
Sure.

25:17.761 --> 25:19.401
A cup of tea.

25:19.521 --> 25:20.881
A cup of weak tea.

25:24.201 --> 25:25.281
Have some tea.

25:25.281 --> 25:26.641
Thank you.

25:27.261 --> 25:28.331
Would you like some tea?

25:28.341 --> 25:29.701
Alright.

25:40.871 --> 25:42.641
Feel free to look around.

25:45.201 --> 25:46.541
Wonton! Noodles!

25:46.561 --> 25:47.981
Wonton! Noodles!

25:48.001 --> 25:50.641
Fresh wonton and noodles!

25:51.841 --> 25:52.841
Wonton!

25:52.841 --> 25:54.601
Lots of filling with thin skin!

25:54.601 --> 25:56.161
Wonton!

25:56.241 --> 25:58.441
Lots of filling with thin skin!

25:58.881 --> 26:00.001
Take a look!

26:00.001 --> 26:01.841
Miss, take a look at this.

26:04.001 --> 26:05.841
Look at this wind chime.

26:14.761 --> 26:16.121
(Where is she?)

26:23.561 --> 26:25.781
Freshly made ice yuanzi!

26:25.801 --> 26:28.201
Take a look!

26:28.201 --> 26:29.841
Freshly made ice yuanzi!

26:29.841 --> 26:31.921
Come and take a look.

26:32.081 --> 26:33.881
Freshly made ice yuanzi!

26:33.881 --> 26:35.241
Shopkeeper.

26:36.081 --> 26:38.021
Miss, what would you like to drink?

26:38.041 --> 26:39.081
A bowl of ice yuanzi.

26:39.081 --> 26:40.701
Sure, please wait a moment.

26:40.721 --> 26:42.081
It'll be right here.

26:43.961 --> 26:46.021
Here you go, ice yuanzi.

26:46.041 --> 26:47.961
- Please enjoy.
- Thank you.

26:51.761 --> 26:52.781
Shopkeeper,

26:52.801 --> 26:55.001
do you know the Earl Dongping's Mansion

26:55.001 --> 26:56.101
on this street?

26:56.121 --> 26:57.081
Yes.

26:57.081 --> 26:59.041
I've been doing business here for years.

26:59.041 --> 27:01.441
Is there something you need?

27:02.561 --> 27:03.981
No, nothing.

27:04.001 --> 27:05.181
Is Earl Dongping's family

27:05.181 --> 27:06.561
originally here,

27:06.561 --> 27:08.461
or did they move from the south?

27:08.481 --> 27:10.041
They've been here

27:10.041 --> 27:11.461
for generations.

27:11.481 --> 27:13.161
They're not new here.

27:17.521 --> 27:19.881
Do you know their fourth young lady?

27:19.961 --> 27:21.801
Miss, you're so kind.

27:21.801 --> 27:23.801
There's no need for this.

27:24.081 --> 27:25.741
You're talking about Jiang Si, right?

27:25.761 --> 27:26.621
She often comes here

27:26.621 --> 27:28.021
with her brother to buy drinks.

27:28.041 --> 27:29.941
So, she was born and raised

27:29.941 --> 27:31.041
in Earl Dongping's Mansion?

27:31.041 --> 27:33.341
Yes, she was born and raised here.

27:33.361 --> 27:34.481
Let me tell you.

27:34.481 --> 27:36.361
This girl is very assertive.

27:36.361 --> 27:37.661
The most popular fragrance shop

27:37.661 --> 27:39.341
in Ling'an

27:39.361 --> 27:40.481
is run by her.

27:40.481 --> 27:41.961
What's the shop's name?

27:42.241 --> 27:43.841
It's called Fragrance Shop.

27:43.841 --> 27:48.201
(Fragrance Shop)

27:53.681 --> 27:57.161
(Jade Bloom Aroma)

28:10.561 --> 28:13.521
(Fragrance Shop)

28:19.881 --> 28:22.201
I didn't expect
Zhao Yu's skill in fragrance

28:22.201 --> 28:24.161
to be on par with mine.

28:26.201 --> 28:27.781
Some of her formulas

28:27.801 --> 28:29.721
are even mine.

28:30.361 --> 28:32.361
But how would she know?

28:33.121 --> 28:35.401
(She asked me about the Saintess.)

28:35.601 --> 28:37.041
(Could it be that she is)

28:37.041 --> 28:38.621
(the Saintess?)

28:38.641 --> 28:40.581
(That's why she knows everything.)

28:40.601 --> 28:42.881
(If she's the Saintess, )

28:43.121 --> 28:44.561
(why would she hide her identity)

28:44.561 --> 28:46.601
(from the Nightingale Division?)

28:48.561 --> 28:50.341
(But the North is far away.)

28:50.361 --> 28:52.081
(It'll take too long)

28:52.201 --> 28:54.201
(to confirm her identity.)

28:54.601 --> 28:56.961
(I need to figure it out asap.)

29:00.881 --> 29:02.761
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

29:02.761 --> 29:04.861
Yu Qi from Capital Security

29:04.881 --> 29:07.041
is the 7th Prince?

29:07.361 --> 29:08.721
Yes.

29:09.801 --> 29:11.541
His Majesty doesn't know

29:11.561 --> 29:13.021
he's back to Ling'an, right?

29:13.041 --> 29:14.301
Yes.

29:14.321 --> 29:16.801
If Yu Qi returns to the imperial family

29:16.801 --> 29:18.341
and becomes a Prince,

29:18.361 --> 29:21.541
it will be harder to handle.

29:21.561 --> 29:23.621
We need to plan ahead.

29:23.641 --> 29:26.221
Yu Qi is a Prince?

29:26.241 --> 29:28.821
He defied the Emperor and came back.

29:28.841 --> 29:30.121
This is a good card

29:30.121 --> 29:31.801
in our hands.

29:32.321 --> 29:33.801
General Cui.

29:43.761 --> 29:45.121
Honey.

29:45.421 --> 29:47.781
How have you been disciplining
our daughter?

29:48.201 --> 29:49.281
Her arrogant temper

29:49.281 --> 29:50.801
needs to be dealt with properly.

29:50.801 --> 29:52.281
- What's wrong?
- What's wrong?

29:52.281 --> 29:54.001
Mingyue was out riding
in the street today

29:54.001 --> 29:55.361
and almost injured someone.

29:55.361 --> 29:56.661
She refused to admit her mistake

29:56.661 --> 29:57.821
and whipped innocent citizens.

29:57.821 --> 29:59.501
Capital Security caught her red-handed.

29:59.521 --> 30:01.021
If I hadn't intervened,

30:01.041 --> 30:03.181
she would've been flogged by now.

30:03.201 --> 30:05.301
Mingyue is my jewel.

30:05.321 --> 30:08.161
Who dares to harm her?

30:10.761 --> 30:11.681
Look at you.

30:11.701 --> 30:13.241
(Graceful and Dignified)
Look at you.

30:13.241 --> 30:14.561
It's because of your attitude

30:14.561 --> 30:16.641
that she's spoiled like this.

30:17.081 --> 30:18.561
What gives you the right

30:18.561 --> 30:20.081
to blame me?

30:20.121 --> 30:21.981
You're accusing me of spoiling Mingyue?

30:22.001 --> 30:23.061
All these years,

30:23.081 --> 30:25.301
have you ever cared about us?

30:25.321 --> 30:27.081
Haven't you always cared

30:27.281 --> 30:30.601
about that woman
in Earl Dongping's Mansion?

30:32.721 --> 30:34.441
It's been so many years, Rongyang.

30:34.441 --> 30:36.321
You always talk
about Earl Dongping's Mansion.

30:36.321 --> 30:38.161
When will you be done with it?

30:38.321 --> 30:39.881
Isn't it true?

30:47.521 --> 30:48.841
You scared me!

30:48.841 --> 30:51.161
- Your Grace.
- Lower your voice.

30:52.641 --> 30:53.701
Your Grace.

30:53.721 --> 30:55.361
How can you eavesdrop?

30:55.361 --> 30:56.771
(Ms. Xu)
If Her Highness finds out,

30:56.781 --> 30:57.761
she'll punish you!

30:57.761 --> 30:58.941
Don't worry about it.

30:58.961 --> 31:00.321
Let me ask you.

31:01.041 --> 31:02.761
Is the woman who caused my father

31:02.761 --> 31:05.061
and mother to drift apart for years

31:05.081 --> 31:06.961
from Earl Dongping's Mansion?

31:07.761 --> 31:10.361
I don't know.

31:10.381 --> 31:11.981
Who are you trying to fool?

31:12.961 --> 31:15.101
You are my mother's wet nurse.

31:15.121 --> 31:17.221
What is there that you don't know?

31:17.241 --> 31:18.961
Just quietly tell me.

31:19.281 --> 31:21.081
I won't tell Mother.

31:23.001 --> 31:26.041
Your Grace, she...

31:26.801 --> 31:29.161
She's Her Highness's metal knot.

31:29.281 --> 31:30.641
She...

31:32.441 --> 31:33.521
Don't ask about it anymore.

31:33.521 --> 31:35.501
Ms. Xu, if you don't tell me,

31:35.521 --> 31:37.241
I'll investigate myself.

31:44.521 --> 31:46.641
Your Grace...

31:47.521 --> 31:49.361
That woman is already dead.

31:49.371 --> 31:51.121
Dead?

32:01.561 --> 32:02.921
Zhan,

32:02.981 --> 32:05.281
how's your study
of military strategy going?

32:06.321 --> 32:08.921
I've already mastered it.

32:09.841 --> 32:11.241
Come on, Zhan.

32:11.801 --> 32:12.861
Si,

32:12.881 --> 32:14.541
I don't need medicine.

32:14.561 --> 32:16.501
If you truly care about me,

32:16.521 --> 32:18.461
could you let me sleep?

32:18.481 --> 32:20.241
This isn't medicine; it's a supplement.

32:20.241 --> 32:21.561
You need to take it before meals.

32:21.561 --> 32:22.801
Breakfast will be here soon.

32:22.801 --> 32:23.761
Supplement?

32:23.761 --> 32:25.121
No, no.

32:26.761 --> 32:27.981
You've been

32:28.001 --> 32:29.301
a bit strange these days.

32:29.321 --> 32:30.761
I'm totally fine.

32:30.761 --> 32:32.561
Why ask the physician to check on me?

32:32.561 --> 32:33.761
The physician already said

32:33.761 --> 32:35.041
my health is great.

32:35.041 --> 32:36.561
I'll live to 88 without any problem.

32:36.581 --> 32:38.441
This prescription was given
by the physician.

32:38.441 --> 32:39.801
It's not for treating any illness,

32:39.801 --> 32:41.681
just to strengthen your body.

32:42.081 --> 32:44.421
Zhan, I started to prepare this

32:44.441 --> 32:46.641
even before the sun came out.

32:47.121 --> 32:49.321
No wonder your eyes are so dark.

32:50.041 --> 32:51.781
Fine, I'll drink it.

32:51.801 --> 32:54.041
Drink it while it's hot.

32:57.761 --> 32:58.821
It's a little bitter.

32:58.841 --> 33:00.101
There are candied treats.

33:00.121 --> 33:02.441
Suck on one.

33:04.481 --> 33:05.781
Drink a bit more.

33:05.801 --> 33:07.481
- More?
- Drink a bit more.

33:14.361 --> 33:15.701
By the way, Zhan,

33:15.721 --> 33:16.941
for this month,

33:16.961 --> 33:18.721
you shouldn't leave the house.

33:21.361 --> 33:22.301
For a month?

33:22.321 --> 33:23.641
If you don't have to go out,

33:23.641 --> 33:25.961
you should just stay in your chamber.

33:33.841 --> 33:34.781
What?

33:34.801 --> 33:36.381
Si, you're not having a fever.

33:36.401 --> 33:37.861
How can you talk nonsense like this?

33:37.881 --> 33:39.841
You want me to stay at home for a month?

33:39.841 --> 33:41.161
You might as well kill me.

33:41.161 --> 33:42.501
It would be quicker.

33:42.521 --> 33:44.041
Stop that nonsense.

33:44.041 --> 33:46.321
Stop saying such inauspicious things.

33:48.261 --> 33:50.481
Touch the wood,
and it wouldn't come true.

33:50.721 --> 33:53.021
Si, why are you angry?

33:53.041 --> 33:54.141
I'm not angry.

33:54.161 --> 33:55.501
Zhan.

33:55.521 --> 33:57.781
Look, since childhood,

33:57.801 --> 33:59.201
I've never asked you for anything,

33:59.201 --> 34:00.561
right?

34:00.601 --> 34:02.141
This time, I'm asking you.

34:02.161 --> 34:03.301
Just one month.

34:03.321 --> 34:04.501
During this month,

34:04.521 --> 34:05.421
you stay at home,

34:05.441 --> 34:06.961
practice martial arts with Master Qin,

34:06.961 --> 34:08.041
and read military books.

34:08.041 --> 34:08.901
After this month,

34:08.901 --> 34:10.281
you can go anywhere you want.

34:10.281 --> 34:12.121
I won't stop you.

34:13.841 --> 34:17.101
But I've already been working hard.

34:17.121 --> 34:19.721
Staying at home for a whole month

34:20.681 --> 34:22.761
is really hard.

34:22.761 --> 34:24.301
Zhan, you see.

34:24.321 --> 34:25.461
After one month, it will be

34:25.481 --> 34:27.361
the selection
for the Imperial Insignia Guard.

34:27.381 --> 34:29.061
If you get selected,

34:29.081 --> 34:30.161
I'll be able to marry

34:30.161 --> 34:31.941
whoever I want

34:31.961 --> 34:33.881
and won't have to suffer anymore.

34:34.641 --> 34:36.601
Zhan, just do it

34:36.601 --> 34:38.641
for my marriage

34:39.121 --> 34:40.521
and my lifelong happiness.

34:40.521 --> 34:41.881
Okay?

34:42.681 --> 34:44.321
Just one month.

34:45.961 --> 34:47.401
Okay.

34:49.041 --> 34:50.401
You're the best.

34:50.801 --> 34:52.601
Miss, breakfast is ready.

34:52.621 --> 34:53.721
Zhan, let's have breakfast.

34:53.721 --> 34:55.121
Perfect. I'm hungry.

34:55.121 --> 34:56.061
By the way, Zhan,

34:56.081 --> 34:58.141
I've informed Grandmother.

34:58.161 --> 34:59.941
From now on, you'll have your meals

34:59.961 --> 35:01.621
in your own room.

35:01.641 --> 35:03.061
You don't need to join us.

35:03.081 --> 35:04.441
Why?

35:06.041 --> 35:07.661
Zhan, eat more eggs.

35:07.681 --> 35:08.581
Wait...

35:08.601 --> 35:09.501
I...

35:09.521 --> 35:10.881
Aman.

35:11.521 --> 35:12.581
Why?

35:12.601 --> 35:14.241
Aman, lock the door.

35:14.321 --> 35:15.821
Lock the door?

35:15.841 --> 35:17.501
Come on, Si.

35:17.521 --> 35:19.061
You can't do that!

35:19.081 --> 35:20.741
You can't lock the door!

35:20.761 --> 35:22.241
Si!

35:51.161 --> 35:54.561
(Administrator Lin,
Zhen Heng's classmate)

36:18.121 --> 36:19.481
Yan'er.

36:29.201 --> 36:31.721
Sir, please have some tea.

36:47.681 --> 36:49.201
What a perfect match.

36:49.201 --> 36:51.121
A match made in heaven.

36:52.121 --> 36:53.921
I'm finally out.

36:53.971 --> 36:56.521
These days have been so boring.

36:59.921 --> 37:01.921
Master Qin Feng.

37:02.001 --> 37:03.781
What brings you here?

37:03.801 --> 37:05.761
I've missed you so much, Master Qin.

37:05.761 --> 37:06.821
Master Qin.

37:06.841 --> 37:08.661
Zhan, long time no see.

37:08.681 --> 37:09.661
You've grown so much.

37:09.681 --> 37:10.921
I almost didn't recognize you.

37:10.921 --> 37:12.381
Of course.

37:12.401 --> 37:14.841
Now, I'm handsome, charming,

37:14.841 --> 37:16.541
and dashing.

37:16.561 --> 37:17.841
Ji, prepare some wine and dishes.

37:17.841 --> 37:19.701
I want to have a good drink
with Master Qin.

37:19.721 --> 37:21.081
Got it.

37:21.641 --> 37:23.781
Master Qin, what brings you here?

37:23.801 --> 37:25.101
I just returned to Ling'an,

37:25.121 --> 37:26.661
and Miss Si asked me

37:26.681 --> 37:28.921
to teach you martial arts every day.

37:29.321 --> 37:31.481
So, from today,

37:31.481 --> 37:32.941
you need to wake up at the Yin hour

37:32.961 --> 37:34.181
and practice with me

37:34.201 --> 37:35.721
to strengthen your body.

37:38.081 --> 37:39.301
At what time?

37:39.321 --> 37:40.941
At the Yin hour every day.

37:41.601 --> 37:43.101
Let me think.

37:43.121 --> 37:44.521
Zi, Chou, Yin...

37:45.721 --> 37:47.701
Since Miss Si entrusted you to me,

37:47.721 --> 37:48.821
I can't let her down.

37:48.841 --> 37:51.041
Master Qin, you don't know...

37:51.561 --> 37:52.441
Si, you're back.

37:52.441 --> 37:53.801
Master Qin.

37:54.001 --> 37:55.101
You brat!

37:55.121 --> 37:56.201
You can leave,

37:56.201 --> 37:57.861
but I know where to find you.

38:06.161 --> 38:08.281
Thanks for today.

38:08.281 --> 38:09.641
It's nothing.

38:16.161 --> 38:18.221
We're leaving then.

38:18.241 --> 38:19.601
Sure.

38:31.121 --> 38:38.641
(Matchmaker Wang's Hall)

39:14.601 --> 39:16.161
Thank you, Mrs. Zhen.

39:17.041 --> 39:18.181
Miss Si, please sit.

39:18.201 --> 39:19.561
Okay.

39:20.881 --> 39:22.871
I'm only helping your sister

39:22.891 --> 39:24.701
because of you.

39:24.721 --> 39:25.621
Otherwise,

39:25.641 --> 39:26.621
with her nature,

39:26.641 --> 39:27.781
I wouldn't help her at all.

39:27.801 --> 39:29.241
Thank you, Mrs. Zhen.

39:29.601 --> 39:31.141
Thank you, Mr. Zhen.

39:31.161 --> 39:32.441
Actually, my sister

39:32.441 --> 39:34.101
was influenced by others.

39:34.121 --> 39:35.821
She wasn't born bad.

39:35.841 --> 39:38.221
One takes the color of one's company.

39:38.241 --> 39:39.401
If she can really marry

39:39.401 --> 39:41.021
Administrator Lin in the future,

39:41.041 --> 39:43.401
I believe she'll change.

39:43.521 --> 39:44.921
Administrator Lin

39:44.921 --> 39:46.181
is quite picky

39:46.201 --> 39:47.921
about marriage,

39:48.521 --> 39:49.661
but I never expected him

39:49.681 --> 39:50.761
to fall for your sister

39:50.761 --> 39:52.681
at first sight.

39:53.001 --> 39:55.041
Fate truly brings people together

39:55.241 --> 39:57.321
from miles away.

39:57.721 --> 39:59.641
Miss, tea is ready.

40:05.001 --> 40:06.821
You two

40:06.841 --> 40:08.621
are both

40:08.641 --> 40:10.141
unmarried.

40:10.161 --> 40:11.201
And yet, you're worrying

40:11.201 --> 40:12.981
about someone else's marriage.

40:13.001 --> 40:14.261
Why don't you think

40:14.281 --> 40:15.921
about yourselves?

40:16.961 --> 40:18.321
Mother.

40:19.641 --> 40:21.201
Mrs. Zhen, have some tea.

40:22.401 --> 40:23.241
Mrs. Zhen,

40:23.241 --> 40:24.741
the tea today

40:24.761 --> 40:26.241
is on me.

40:29.321 --> 40:30.681
What?

40:30.801 --> 40:31.961
You want to thank me

40:31.961 --> 40:33.261
with a cup of tea?

40:33.281 --> 40:34.881
It's not that easy.

40:38.081 --> 40:39.441
Shopkeeper.

40:39.601 --> 40:40.961
Coming.

40:42.201 --> 40:44.761
I heard you had new tea leaves
in the backyard.

40:44.761 --> 40:46.241
Take me to see it.

40:46.321 --> 40:47.681
Please, Mrs. Zhen.

41:05.721 --> 41:06.621
Miss Jiang.

41:06.641 --> 41:08.401
How about more tea?

41:08.401 --> 41:09.561
Please let me, Mr. Zhen.

41:09.561 --> 41:10.921
It's okay.

41:11.121 --> 41:12.481
Let me do it.

41:13.841 --> 41:15.201
Thank you.

41:20.801 --> 41:21.941
How is it?

41:21.961 --> 41:23.561
The man I chose for you is good, right?

41:23.561 --> 41:25.761
He looks like a gentleman,

41:26.161 --> 41:27.601
but

41:27.601 --> 41:29.141
he's only a 6th Rank official.

41:29.161 --> 41:31.321
Our family at least has a title.

41:31.801 --> 41:34.101
That title is just a name.

41:34.121 --> 41:35.081
You know

41:35.081 --> 41:36.621
the state of our family.

41:37.601 --> 41:40.121
We might not carry such honor.

41:40.321 --> 41:42.781
Though his rank isn't high,

41:42.801 --> 41:44.181
he has actual power.

41:44.201 --> 41:45.821
If you find the right man,

41:45.841 --> 41:47.001
your later life

41:47.001 --> 41:48.521
is guaranteed.

41:48.561 --> 41:50.301
Mother, you're not ambitious at all.

41:50.321 --> 41:51.801
Your lineal mother is ambitious.

41:51.821 --> 41:53.241
She worked hard to marry your sister

41:53.241 --> 41:55.421
into that wealthy family,

41:55.441 --> 41:56.641
but you know

41:56.641 --> 41:58.001
what happened.

41:58.041 --> 41:59.241
Don't ask

41:59.241 --> 42:00.661
for more than fate grants you.

42:00.681 --> 42:01.561
Don't always look

42:01.561 --> 42:03.641
at what others have.

42:05.081 --> 42:06.221
Pei,

42:06.241 --> 42:08.221
just listen to me.

42:08.241 --> 42:10.361
If you miss this marriage,

42:10.481 --> 42:12.401
it will truly be gone.

42:16.081 --> 42:18.261
Chief, I lost Liu Yan'er last night.

42:18.281 --> 42:19.441
She refused to receive guests,

42:19.441 --> 42:20.481
dressed up, and went out

42:20.481 --> 42:22.101
to visit only common places.

42:22.121 --> 42:23.451
Nothing special.

42:23.471 --> 42:25.501
But she's cautious,

42:25.521 --> 42:27.641
unlike an ordinary courtesan.

42:27.661 --> 42:28.861
Don't follow her too closely,

42:28.861 --> 42:30.041
or the effort will be in vain.

42:30.041 --> 42:31.401
Yes.

42:33.401 --> 42:34.621
Miss Jiang.

42:34.641 --> 42:35.621
Miss Jiang.

42:35.641 --> 42:37.181
Please stop calling me Mr. Zhen

42:37.201 --> 42:38.581
outside the court.

42:38.601 --> 42:41.161
It would seem distant.

42:41.601 --> 42:42.941
Then...

42:42.961 --> 42:44.521
Should I call you

42:45.241 --> 42:46.541
Zhen?

42:46.561 --> 42:47.581
That'd be great.

42:47.601 --> 42:48.961
Zhen.

42:49.121 --> 42:53.481
(The End of Episode 11)

42:53.892 --> 42:55.622
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.622 --> 43:00.562
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:00.932 --> 43:03.312
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.312 --> 43:07.542
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.252 --> 43:10.652
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.672 --> 43:14.332
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.352 --> 43:17.772
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:17.922 --> 43:23.442
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.262 --> 43:27.942
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:27.942 --> 43:32.022
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.262 --> 43:34.002
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.022 --> 43:38.722
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:38.722 --> 43:42.292
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.312 --> 43:46.542
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.562 --> 43:48.342
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.342 --> 43:52.882
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:52.902 --> 43:57.702
♪ And stars ♪

44:01.932 --> 44:04.462
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.482 --> 44:08.102
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.122 --> 44:11.552
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.572 --> 44:16.192
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.192 --> 44:19.882
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:19.902 --> 44:23.992
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.102 --> 44:25.922
♪ Time glows ♪

44:25.922 --> 44:30.472
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.492 --> 44:34.192
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.212 --> 44:38.372
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.552 --> 44:40.312
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.312 --> 44:44.832
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:44.832 --> 44:48.472
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.492 --> 44:54.162
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:55.852 --> 44:57.782
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:57.782 --> 45:05.282
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
